    "innovation": "This paper quantifies the severe degradation of Iraq's Al-Razzaza Lake, using remote sensing to document a 65.5% reduction in water surface area between 2004 and 2024 and establishing a strong statistical correlation between this decline and changing climate variables like temperature and rainfall.",
